.TH DA4LINUX 1 "2026-08-06" "da4linux 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
da4linux \- Dolby Audio-like processing for Linux via PipeWire
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B da4linux
\fI\,COMMAND\/\fR [\fI\,OPTIONS\/\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
DA4Linux generates PipeWire filter-chain configurations that apply
professional-grade DSP processing to system audio output. It reads
Dolby DAX3 XML tuning files (from Windows drivers) or uses built-in
profiles to produce device-specific audio enhancement chains.
.PP
The processing runs entirely inside the PipeWire audio server.
No persistent daemon is required.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
\fBdetect\fR
Detect audio hardware and print device information.
.TP
\fBparse\fR \fIXML_FILE\fR
Parse a DAX3 XML tuning file and display its contents.
.TP
\fBgenerate\fR
Generate and install a PipeWire filter-chain config. This is the
main command.
.TP
\fBstatus\fR
Show current DA4Linux status and configuration.
.SH GENERATE OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-xml\fR \fIFILE\fR
DAX3 XML tuning file path (uses built-in profile if omitted).
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fIDIR\fR
Output directory (default: ~/.config/pipewire/pipewire.conf.d).
.TP
\fB\-\-profile\fR \fIKEY\fR
Profile name override.
.TP
\fB\-\-mode\fR \fIMODE\fR
Processing mode: music, movie, or voice (default: music).
.TP
\fB\-\-stages\fR \fILIST\fR
Comma-separated stages to enable.
.TP
\fB\-\-disable\fR \fILIST\fR
Comma-separated stages to disable.
.TP
\fB\-\-hrir\fR \fIFILE\fR
Path to SOFA HRTF file for virtual surround.
.SH FILES
.TP
\fI~/.config/pipewire/pipewire.conf.d/50-da4linux.conf\fR
Generated PipeWire filter-chain configuration.
.TP
\fI~/.local/share/da4linux/ir/\fR
Impulse response WAV files for speaker correction.
.TP
\fI~/.local/share/da4linux/hrir/\fR
SOFA HRTF files for virtual surround.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
\fBDA4LINUX_HOME\fR
Override the module installation directory.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success, non-zero on error.
